lease; no audio/timeline delay. Runtime source update and actual video QA are required. At every Phase1-to-Phase2 entry read phase02-transition-gate.mjs handoff_context. GitHub is version-pinned executable transport from SeikoP/project-zodiac-video, never a replacement creative brief or approval authority; use the active plugin and approved episode contracts. Complete native manifest steps, then force phase02-execute.mjs --run --finalize-manifest before sealing. Phase03 stages only registered assets; unregistered legacy files stay in source. Authored frame continuity is a review diagnostic; geometric/contact gates remain required. RELEASE 2.4.60: Scene-set is the first-class Phase02 visual scaffold and is distinct from shot-layout skeletons. Scene accents are optional minimal context cues and must remain inside the authored scene-set wall region. Story Object may be a symbolic thought-metaphor such as the Libra scale; it is not automatically a physical prop, and physical contact is required only for physical_interaction. Fresh selection must not load compatibility room/window/furniture cues unless explicitly selected. Reusing an approved scene-set across scenes is continuity, not wallpaper by itself. Native dependency fingerprints should follow the selected asset/compiler graph for visual-intent workspaces; legacy workspaces retain full compatibility fallback."
